  "name": "Peach Cobbler",
  "subtitle": "A warm, fruit-filled dessert with a tender baked topping.",
  "description": "Butter, sweet batter, and sliced peaches bake together into an easy cobbler for serving warm.",
  "meal_type": "dessert",
